1
00:00:00,610 --> 00:00:02,110
(Penny(waking up):)Okay, look.

2
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:03,610
(Penny(waking up):)This never happened.

3
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:05,340
(Penny(waking up):)Do you understand me?

4
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:10,320
Really?! Still
can't talk to me?

5
00:00:14,090 --> 00:00:16,020
(Leonard:)What are you
doing here?

6
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:16,640
(Howard:)What?

7
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:18,550
(Sheldon:)I said, what are you doing here?

8
00:00:18,550 --> 00:00:20,330
(Leonard:)I live here.

9
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:23,660
(Sheldon:)I have paperwork
that says differently.

10
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,700
(Leonard:)Priya's going back to India.

11
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,270
(Sheldon:)Irrelevant.

12
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,000
(Sheldon:)Rajesh and I have
a good thing going

13
00:00:32,010 --> 00:00:33,540
(Sheldon:)and you're not going to ruin it.

14
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:38,380
(Leonard:)What are you doing here?

15
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:40,380
(Howard:)I've been up all night.

16
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:42,580
(Howard:)- I had a fight with Bernadette.
- Why?

17
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:45,550
(Howard:)She gave me
a beautiful watch.

18
00:00:48,190 --> 00:00:50,420
(Sheldon:)Leonard, do you
understand this?

19
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:51,860
(Howard:)Yes.

20
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:53,390
(Sheldon:)Talk to him.

21
00:01:01,730 --> 00:01:03,740
(Penny(entering room dishevelled, with a half naked Raj behind):)Damn.

22
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:06,900
(Leonard:)What's going on?

23
00:01:06,910 --> 00:01:09,240
(Leonard:)Oh...

24
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:11,510
It's-it's not what
it looks like.

25
00:01:14,810 --> 00:01:16,550
(Sheldon:)What does it look like?

